    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43990" root="&#xA;                        نصى&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصِىٌّ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A certain plant:</i> (S, TA:) Golius says,
<i>a species of thistle;</i> but this seems to be inconsistent with the description of it: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَيِّجَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَصِىٌّ نَصِيٌّ</span>
                        <i>Gelded, castrated.</i> The second word
is an imitative sequent.

